#: kcm_kbluetoothd.cpp:109
msgid ""
"<h1>KBluetoothD</h1>This module configures kbluetoothd, the meta server of "
"the KDE Bluetooth Framework. It manages Bluetooth services offered by your "
"system and can launch programs when Bluetooth devices were detected."
msgstr ""

